            "pc_requirements": {
                "minimum": "<strong>Mínimos:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Sistema Operativo:</strong> Windows 10 (64bit versions)<br></li><li><strong>Processador:</strong> Intel i3 550 @ 3.2 GHz or AMD Phenom II X4 955 @ 3.2 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memória:</strong> 4 GB de RAM<br></li><li><strong>Placa gráfica:</strong> nVidia GeForce 460GTv2 or AMD Radeon HD5770(1024MB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Versão 11<br></li><li><strong>Espaço no disco:</strong> Requer 1 GB de espaço livre<br></li><li><strong>Placa de som:</strong> DirectX Compatible Sound Card with latest drivers<br></li><li><strong>Notas adicionais:</strong> Best played with a gamepad. originally released for Windows 7, the game can be played on Windows 10 and Windows 11 OS</li></ul>",
                "recommended": "<strong>Recomendados:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Sistema Operativo:</strong> Windows 10 (64bit versions)<br></li><li><strong>Processador:</strong> Intel Core i3 2105 @ 3.1 GHz or AMD FX 4100 @ 3.6 GHz, or better<br></li><li><strong>Memória:</strong> 8 GB de RAM<br></li><li><strong>Placa gráfica:</strong> nVidia GeForce GTX 660(2048 MB VRAM)or AMD Radeon HD 7870(2048 MB VRAM)or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Versão 11<br></li><li><strong>Espaço no disco:</strong> Requer 1 GB de espaço livre<br></li><li><strong>Placa de som:</strong> DirectX Compatible Sound Card with latest drivers<br></li><li><strong>Notas adicionais:</strong> Best played with a gamepad. originally released for Windows 7, the game can be played on Windows 10 and Windows 11 OS</li></ul>"
